{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794550385257,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","part":{"partID":"prt_1d3897ef8001hTCRRuQowDED7W","sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","messageID":"msg_1d389730d001TxLcs3RsTvoD81","type":"tool","id":"call_2894c8beefa041f3a96a684e","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner Lineage\n\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\n\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder target)\n- Fan-out lineage: `accuracy-runner` (artifact dir `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner`)\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n- Stop conditions: legal convergence at `convergenceThreshold=0.10`, or `maxIterations=5`, whichever comes first\n- Success criteria: every accuracy-runner scoped file reviewed at least once; findings carry `file:line`; holdout hygiene verified by counts only\n- Review focus (operator bound): command-surfacing review of routing-accuracy runners and their corpora; cross-runtime behaviour (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh); safety of offering a mutating command; holdout hygiene; docs that disagree with code\n- Resource map: `resource-map.md` not present; skipping coverage gate\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nCommand surfacing behavior for the routed skill/command advisor, restricted to the `accuracy-runner` area: the routing-accuracy measurement harness (`runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/`), prompt corpora and fixtures, cost-measurement benches, transcript scoring, transcript/offer tests, and the legacy fidelity tests plus the manual-testing playbook that documents how to run them.\n\n---\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not reviewing `scorer-attach`, `render-hooks-plugin`, or `doctor-install` area files except as read-only context when a cross-area contract is required\n- Not reviewing the spec packet docs as an authorship target; they are traceability context\n- Not fixing anything: the review is observation-only\n- Not reading or printing holdout prompt text; holdout coverage is counts-only\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Legal convergence (all dimensions covered plus stabilization) at or below `convergenceThreshold`\n- `maxIterations=5` reached (`stopReason: maxIterationsReached`)\n- Any active P0 blocks a PASS verdict but does not stop iteration dispatch by itself; the P0 override keeps `newFindingsRatio >= 0.50`\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy, runtime/tests/legacy, manual-testing-playbook\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n[Populated from iteration dead-end data]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Files: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `run-command-behaviour.mjs`, `command-offer.mjs`, `prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs`, `worktree-restore.mjs`, `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs`\n- Why: first pass establishes the behavior contract of the accuracy harness before traceability and maintainability passes\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: 29 `accuracy-runner` files from `review-scope.txt` (routing-accuracy runners/corpora, cost benches, transcript/offer tests, legacy fidelity tests, manual-testing playbook). Shared docs: `system-skill-advisor/SKILL.md`, `README.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `runtime/scripts/README.md`, `runtime/tests/README.md`, `feature-catalog/*`, `sk-doc` docs.\n- Behavior claims to verify: routed command surfacing must be cross-runtime correct (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh); a mutating command must never be offered unsafely (no implicit `:auto` invocation of a writing workflow); holdout rows must never be read by tune/fix/report paths; documentation must match runner behavior.\n- Reuse and conventions: append-gateway state recording, `validate.sh --strict` evidence discipline, P0/P1/P2 severity ladder, three-artifact iteration contract.\n- Review risks and gaps: holdout prompt text is out of read scope (counts only); fan-out containment forbids running repo tooling that writes outside the lineage, so runners are audited by reading, not by execution; coverage graph seed skipped by containment (see edge cases).\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/` (12 files) | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-brief-cost.mjs`, `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/bench/hook-brief-signal-noise.bench.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/fixtures/gate2-golden-prompts.jsonl`, `skill-advisor-regression-cases.jsonl` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-offer.vitest.ts`, `command-routing-slice.vitest.ts`, `command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/legacy/` (5 files) | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md`, `native-cli-tools/hub-command-attachment.md` | - | - | - | pending |\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 5\n- Convergence threshold: 0.10\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-accuracy-runner-1794550137809-1ecgc7, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-13T06:12:20Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner Lineage\\n\\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\\n\\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder target)\\n- Fan-out lineage: `accuracy-runner` (artifact dir `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner`)\\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\\n- Stop conditions: legal convergence at `convergenceThreshold=0.10`, or `maxIterations=5`, whichever comes first\\n- Success criteria: every accuracy-runner scoped file reviewed at least once; findings carry `file:line`; holdout hygiene verified by counts only\\n- Review focus (operator bound): command-surfacing review of routing-accuracy runners and their corpora; cross-runtime behaviour (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh); safety of offering a mutating command; holdout hygiene; docs that disagree with code\\n- Resource map: `resource-map.md` not present; skipping coverage gate\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nCommand surfacing behavior for the routed skill/command advisor, restricted to the `accuracy-runner` area: the routing-accuracy measurement harness (`runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/`), prompt corpora and fixtures, cost-measurement benches, transcript scoring, transcript/offer tests, and the legacy fidelity tests plus the manual-testing playbook that documents how to run them.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Not reviewing `scorer-attach`, `render-hooks-plugin`, or `doctor-install` area files except as read-only context when a cross-area contract is required\\n- Not reviewing the spec packet docs as an authorship target; they are traceability context\\n- Not fixing anything: the review is observation-only\\n- Not reading or printing holdout prompt text; holdout coverage is counts-only\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Legal convergence (all dimensions covered plus stabilization) at or below `convergenceThreshold`\\n- `maxIterations=5` reached (`stopReason: maxIterationsReached`)\\n- Any active P0 blocks a PASS verdict but does not stop iteration dispatch by itself; the P0 override keeps `newFindingsRatio >= 0.50`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy, runtime/tests/legacy, manual-testing-playbook\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n[Populated from iteration dead-end data]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Dimension: correctness\\n- Files: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `run-command-behaviour.mjs`, `command-offer.mjs`, `prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs`, `worktree-restore.mjs`, `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs`\\n- Why: first pass establishes the behavior contract of the accuracy harness before traceability and maintainability passes\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: 29 `accuracy-runner` files from `review-scope.txt` (routing-accuracy runners/corpora, cost benches, transcript/offer tests, legacy fidelity tests, manual-testing playbook). Shared docs: `system-skill-advisor/SKILL.md`, `README.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `runtime/scripts/README.md`, `runtime/tests/README.md`, `feature-catalog/*`, `sk-doc` docs.\\n- Behavior claims to verify: routed command surfacing must be cross-runtime correct (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh); a mutating command must never be offered unsafely (no implicit `:auto` invocation of a writing workflow); holdout rows must never be read by tune/fix/report paths; documentation must match runner behavior.\\n- Reuse and conventions: append-gateway state recording, `validate.sh --strict` evidence discipline, P0/P1/P2 severity ladder, three-artifact iteration contract.\\n- Review risks and gaps: holdout prompt text is out of read scope (counts only); fan-out containment forbids running repo tooling that writes outside the lineage, so runners are audited by reading, not by execution; coverage graph seed skipped by containment (see edge cases).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | - |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/` (12 files) | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-brief-cost.mjs`, `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/bench/hook-brief-signal-noise.bench.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/fixtures/gate2-golden-prompts.jsonl`, `skill-advisor-regression-cases.jsonl` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-offer.vitest.ts`, `command-routing-slice.vitest.ts`, `command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/legacy/` (5 files) | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md`, `native-cli-tools/hub-command-attachment.md` | - | - | - | pending |\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 5\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.10\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-accuracy-runner-1794550137809-1ecgc7, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-13T06:12:20Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794550365944,"end":1794550385257}}}}
