{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794550549743,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","part":{"partID":"prt_1d38c44c20024jhQV3WEq1Aryn","sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","messageID":"msg_1d38c3211001W5MHAblxAtsJE5","type":"tool","id":"call_f1b89b4633df4589b7d4ba64","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -rn \"command-routing-baseline\" --include=*.mjs --include=*.ts --include=*.cjs --include=*.json --include=*.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor | grep -v \"routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json:\" | head -30"},"output":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/command-meaning-matching.md:44:`capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs --real-embedding` scores the command corpus against this machine's skill graph and live embedder. It first checks that the embedder serves `nomic-embed-text` and that a `vec_cmd_*` table holds vectors, and it refuses `--write`. The committed baseline still comes from the fixture run, which has no real cosine.\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/command-meaning-matching.md:59:| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs` | Script | The `--real-embedding` measurement |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:16:import { scoreCommandCorpus as captureCommandCorpus } from '../scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs';\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:21:const BASELINE_PATH = join(ROUTING, 'command-routing-baseline.json');\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:22:const RECAPTURE = 'node scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs --write';\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/README.md:159:| `command-routing-slice.vitest.ts` | Holds live command routing to `scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json` row by row, pins the corpus hash and requires a typed row and both plain splits for every command file. |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:86:`capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs` reports typed reach twice under `attachedMetrics`:\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:110:| `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs` | Scores `command-prompts.jsonl` under the pinned regime and prints or writes the baseline. Its `attachedMetrics` key holds own-row, attached and combined plain reach per split and per command family, attached false offers, the typed rows where a command and its owner skill read as ambiguous, and the command attached to each row. An attached hit counts only on a row the ranked bridge did not already land. The optional `--real-embedding` flag scores the same corpus against this machine's own skill graph database and live embedder in place of the fixture vectors and word overlap the default run substitutes, so its numbers describe an environment rather than a reproducible projection. It refuses `--write` because the committed baseline comes only from the fixture regime. Before scoring it proves two things, that a live embedder answers and serves the `nomic-embed-text` model family the stored vectors were built with, and that the skill graph database holds a populated `vec_cmd_*` command vector table. A missing piece exits 2 with a message that names it. Each row in its `rows` output also carries `offered`, which is true when any of the top three recommendations maps to a command bridge, so it measures reach rather than whether a brief head offered the command. |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:114:| `command-routing-baseline.json` | Captured command routing numbers that `tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts` holds the scorer to. |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:36://   node capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs            # print JSON to stdout\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:37://   node capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs --write    # also write the baseline\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:38://   node capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs --real-embedding   # score live vectors\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:61:const OUTPUT_JSON = resolve(HERE, 'command-routing-baseline.json');\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:661:    process.stderr.write('capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs: --write cannot be combined with --real-embedding; the committed baseline is captured under the fixture regime only\\n');\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:674:    process.stderr.write(`capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs: ${error.message}\\n`);\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/command-meaning-matching.md:44:`capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs --real-embedding` scores the command corpus against this machine's skill graph and live embedder. It first checks that the embedder serves `nomic-embed-text` and that a `vec_cmd_*` table holds vectors, and it refuses `--write`. The committed baseline still comes from the fixture run, which has no real cosine.\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/command-meaning-matching.md:59:| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs` | Script | The `--real-embedding` measurement |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:16:import { scoreCommandCorpus as captureCommandCorpus } from '../scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs';\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:21:const BASELINE_PATH = join(ROUTING, 'command-routing-baseline.json');\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:22:const RECAPTURE = 'node scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs --write';\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/README.md:159:| `command-routing-slice.vitest.ts` | Holds live command routing to `scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json` row by row, pins the corpus hash and requires a typed row and both plain splits for every command file. |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:86:`capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs` reports typed reach twice under `attachedMetrics`:\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:110:| `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs` | Scores `command-prompts.jsonl` under the pinned regime and prints or writes the baseline. Its `attachedMetrics` key holds own-row, attached and combined plain reach per split and per command family, attached false offers, the typed rows where a command and its owner skill read as ambiguous, and the command attached to each row. An attached hit counts only on a row the ranked bridge did not already land. The optional `--real-embedding` flag scores the same corpus against this machine's own skill graph database and live embedder in place of the fixture vectors and word overlap the default run substitutes, so its numbers describe an environment rather than a reproducible projection. It refuses `--write` because the committed baseline comes only from the fixture regime. Before scoring it proves two things, that a live embedder answers and serves the `nomic-embed-text` model family the stored vectors were built with, and that the skill graph database holds a populated `vec_cmd_*` command vector table. A missing piece exits 2 with a message that names it. Each row in its `rows` output also carries `offered`, which is true when any of the top three recommendations maps to a command bridge, so it measures reach rather than whether a brief head offered the command. |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:114:| `command-routing-baseline.json` | Captured command routing numbers that `tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts` holds the scorer to. |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:36://   node capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs            # print JSON to stdout\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:37://   node capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs --write    # also write the baseline\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:38://   node capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs --real-embedding   # score live vectors\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:61:const OUTPUT_JSON = resolve(HERE, 'command-routing-baseline.json');\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:661:    process.stderr.write('capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs: --write cannot be combined with --real-embedding; the committed baseline is captured under the fixture regime only\\n');\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:674:    process.stderr.write(`capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs: ${error.message}\\n`);\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -rn \\\"command-routing-baseline\\\" --include=*.mjs --include=*.ts --include=*.cjs --include=*.json --include=*.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor | grep -v \\\"routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json:\\\" | head -30\"}"},"time":{"start":1794550547650,"end":1794550549743}}}}
