{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794550873199,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","part":{"partID":"prt_1d3913513001mtDXlOfefmdmtZ","sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","messageID":"msg_1d3911967001aTeLu69mgo4aM3","type":"tool","id":"call_e79b399effb84d3eabf6a3cb","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Reading the invariant at both ends (holdout guard in scorer/runner vs. report publication in baseline) surfaced a leak a single-file read would miss (iteration 1).\n- Counting corpus splits through `split`/`row_type` tallies instead of prompt text kept the review holdout-safe while still proving composition (iteration 1).\n- Checking every renderer head shape against `BRIEF_PATTERN` eliminated a suspected false-negative instead of reporting it (iteration 1).\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n- An early suspicion that the README named a non-existent Python file was wrong; the file exists, so the finding was narrowed to the real inventory drift (iteration 1).","oldString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -67,14 +67,16 @@\n \n ---\n \n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n-[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\n+- Reading the invariant at both ends (holdout guard in scorer/runner vs. report publication in baseline) surfaced a leak a single-file read would miss (iteration 1).\n+- Counting corpus splits through `split`/`row_type` tallies instead of prompt text kept the review holdout-safe while still proving composition (iteration 1).\n+- Checking every renderer head shape against `BRIEF_PATTERN` eliminated a suspected false-negative instead of reporting it (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n-[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\n+- An early suspicion that the README named a non-existent Python file was wrong; the file exists, so the finding was narrowed to the real inventory drift (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n ## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n","status":"modified","additions":4,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n- Reading the invariant at both ends (holdout guard in scorer/runner vs. report publication in baseline) surfaced a leak a single-file read would miss (iteration 1).\\n- Counting corpus splits through `split`/`row_type` tallies instead of prompt text kept the review holdout-safe while still proving composition (iteration 1).\\n- Checking every renderer head shape against `BRIEF_PATTERN` eliminated a suspected false-negative instead of reporting it (iteration 1).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n- An early suspicion that the README named a non-existent Python file was wrong; the file exists, so the finding was narrowed to the real inventory drift (iteration 1).\",\"oldString\":\"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n[Populated after iteration 1 completes]\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794550871315,"end":1794550873199}}}}
