{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794550992142,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","part":{"partID":"prt_1d39309aa002epsvTwDi7uVIvb","sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","messageID":"msg_1d392ef34001BRmMm7Bk4Aj9RY","type":"tool","id":"call_09adf3a939a4426a9e6fb77b","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner && node -e '\nconst r=require(\"./deep-review-findings-registry.json\");\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify(r.openFindings[0],null,1).slice(0,1200));\nconsole.log(\"keys:\",Object.keys(r));\n'; echo \"=== strategy head ===\"; sed -n '1,60p' deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"{\n \"findingId\": \"iter1-P1-holdout-baseline-publication\",\n \"severity\": \"P1\",\n \"title\": \"Committed baseline publishes per-row holdout outcomes and a test pins them\",\n \"file\": \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\",\n \"line\": 537,\n \"description\": \"\",\n \"findingClass\": null,\n \"deltaStatus\": null,\n \"scopeProof\": null,\n \"affectedSurfaceHints\": [],\n \"contentHash\": null,\n \"dimension\": \"correctness\",\n \"firstSeen\": 1,\n \"lastSeen\": 1,\n \"status\": \"active\",\n \"transitions\": [\n  {\n   \"iteration\": 1,\n   \"from\": null,\n   \"to\": \"P1\",\n   \"reason\": \"Initial discovery (delta)\"\n  }\n ],\n \"dimensions\": [\n  \"correctness\"\n ],\n \"mergedFindingIds\": []\n}\nkeys: [\n  'sessionId',              'parentSessionId',\n  'generation',             'lineageMode',\n  'continuedFromRun',       'terminalStop',\n  'status',                 'openFindings',\n  'resolvedFindings',       'blockedStopHistory',\n  'persistentSameSeverity', 'severityChanged',\n  'repeatedFindings',       'dimensionCoverage',\n  'findingsBySeverity',     'openFindingsCount',\n  'resolvedFindingsCount',  'convergenceScore',\n  'graphConvergenceScore',  'graphDecision',\n  'graphBlockers',          'graphSignals',\n  'candidateCoverage',      'searchDebt',\n  'ruledOutCandidates',     'cleanSearchProof',\n  'searchCoverage',         'traceability',\n  'divergence',             'fieldWarnings',\n  'corruptionWarnings'\n]\n=== strategy head ===\n# Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner Lineage\n\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\n\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder target)\n- Fan-out lineage: `accuracy-runner` (artifact dir `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner`)\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n- Stop conditions: legal convergence at `convergenceThreshold=0.10`, or `maxIterations=5`, whichever comes first\n- Success criteria: every accuracy-runner scoped file reviewed at least once; findings carry `file:line`; holdout hygiene verified by counts only\n- Review focus (operator bound): command-surfacing review of routing-accuracy runners and their corpora; cross-runtime behaviour (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh); safety of offering a mutating command; holdout hygiene; docs that disagree with code\n- Resource map: `resource-map.md` not present; skipping coverage gate\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nCommand surfacing behavior for the routed skill/command advisor, restricted to the `accuracy-runner` area: the routing-accuracy measurement harness (`runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/`), prompt corpora and fixtures, cost-measurement benches, transcript scoring, transcript/offer tests, and the legacy fidelity tests plus the manual-testing playbook that documents how to run them.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] security\n- [ ] traceability\n- [ ] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not reviewing `scorer-attach`, `render-hooks-plugin`, or `doctor-install` area files except as read-only context when a cross-area contract is required\n- Not reviewing the spec packet docs as an authorship target; they are traceability context\n- Not fixing anything: the review is observation-only\n- Not reading or printing holdout prompt text; holdout coverage is counts-only\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Legal convergence (all dimensions covered plus stabilization) at or below `convergenceThreshold`\n- `maxIterations=5` reached (`stopReason: maxIterationsReached`)\n- Any active P0 blocks a PASS verdict but does not stop iteration dispatch by itself; the P0 override keeps `newFindingsRatio >= 0.50`\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 1\n- P2 (Suggestions): 2\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Reading the invariant at both ends (holdout guard in scorer/runner vs. report publication in baseline) surfaced a leak a single-file read would miss (iteration 1).\n- Counting corpus splits through `split`/`row_type` tallies instead of prompt text kept the review holdout-safe while still proving composition (iteration 1).\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n \"findingId\": \"iter1-P1-holdout-baseline-publication\",\n \"severity\": \"P1\",\n \"title\": \"Committed baseline publishes per-row holdout outcomes and a test pins them\",\n \"file\": \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\",\n \"line\": 537,\n \"description\": \"\",\n \"findingClass\": null,\n \"deltaStatus\": null,\n \"scopeProof\": null,\n \"affectedSurfaceHints\": [],\n \"contentHash\": null,\n \"dimension\": \"correctness\",\n \"firstSeen\": 1,\n \"lastSeen\": 1,\n \"status\": \"active\",\n \"transitions\": [\n  {\n   \"iteration\": 1,\n   \"from\": null,\n   \"to\": \"P1\",\n   \"reason\": \"Initial discovery (delta)\"\n  }\n ],\n \"dimensions\": [\n  \"correctness\"\n ],\n \"mergedFindingIds\": []\n}\nkeys: [\n  'sessionId',              'parentSessionId',\n  'generation',             'lineageMode',\n  'continuedFromRun',       'terminalStop',\n  'status',                 'openFindings',\n  'resolvedFindings',       'blockedStopHistory',\n  'persistentSameSeverity', 'severityChanged',\n  'repeatedFindings',       'dimensionCoverage',\n  'findingsBySeverity',     'openFindingsCount',\n  'resolvedFindingsCount',  'convergenceScore',\n  'graphConvergenceScore',  'graphDecision',\n  'graphBlockers',          'graphSignals',\n  'candidateCoverage',      'searchDebt',\n  'ruledOutCandidates',     'cleanSearchProof',\n  'searchCoverage',         'traceability',\n  'divergence',             'fieldWarnings',\n  'corruptionWarnings'\n]\n=== strategy head ===\n# Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner Lineage\n\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\n\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder target)\n- Fan-out lineage: `accuracy-runner` (artifact dir `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner`)\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n- Stop conditions: legal convergence at `convergenceThreshold=0.10`, or `maxIterations=5`, whichever comes first\n- Success criteria: every accuracy-runner scoped file reviewed at least once; findings carry `file:line`; holdout hygiene verified by counts only\n- Review focus (operator bound): command-surfacing review of routing-accuracy runners and their corpora; cross-runtime behaviour (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh); safety of offering a mutating command; holdout hygiene; docs that disagree with code\n- Resource map: `resource-map.md` not present; skipping coverage gate\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nCommand surfacing behavior for the routed skill/command advisor, restricted to the `accuracy-runner` area: the routing-accuracy measurement harness (`runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/`), prompt corpora and fixtures, cost-measurement benches, transcript scoring, transcript/offer tests, and the legacy fidelity tests plus the manual-testing playbook that documents how to run them.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] security\n- [ ] traceability\n- [ ] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not reviewing `scorer-attach`, `render-hooks-plugin`, or `doctor-install` area files except as read-only context when a cross-area contract is required\n- Not reviewing the spec packet docs as an authorship target; they are traceability context\n- Not fixing anything: the review is observation-only\n- Not reading or printing holdout prompt text; holdout coverage is counts-only\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Legal convergence (all dimensions covered plus stabilization) at or below `convergenceThreshold`\n- `maxIterations=5` reached (`stopReason: maxIterationsReached`)\n- Any active P0 blocks a PASS verdict but does not stop iteration dispatch by itself; the P0 override keeps `newFindingsRatio >= 0.50`\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 1\n- P2 (Suggestions): 2\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Reading the invariant at both ends (holdout guard in scorer/runner vs. report publication in baseline) surfaced a leak a single-file read would miss (iteration 1).\n- Counting corpus splits through `split`/`row_type` tallies instead of prompt text kept the review holdout-safe while still proving composition (iteration 1).\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner && node -e '\\nconst r=require(\\\"./deep-review-findings-registry.json\\\");\\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify(r.openFindings[0],null,1).slice(0,1200));\\nconsole.log(\\\"keys:\\\",Object.keys(r));\\n'; echo \\\"=== strategy head ===\\\"; sed -n '1,60p' deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794550991274,"end":1794550992142}}}}
