n122:| 7 | 007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/ | Transcript proof per runtime and the started-command-is-followed check (R8 transcripts, G2, G5) | In Progress |\n125:| 10 | 010-reachability-and-attribution/ | Offer and brief delivery on every run line with a backfill of the before arm, an attributable scorer summary, the Codex and DSH install steps with read-only doctor checks and a measured cold first prompt (research ranks 1 to 6 and 10) | Complete |\n127:| 12 | 012-plain-offer-reach/ | A plain request gets its command: the doctor hand-off names the command its ranker put first, task-shaped aliases on the `sk-doc` and deep-loop hubs, deep and create anchors and a `(needs a mode)` label for a deferring hub, measured as plain tune offers 9 to 23 of 45 in the command capture (segment two ranks 1, 4, 6, 7 and 12) | Complete |\n128:| 13 | 013-attribution-and-install-reach/ | Brief delivery as a stored fact on five runtimes, offer accounting with loop-without-init in the safety floor and host-expanded typed starts counted, a Codex preflight and a restore to HEAD in the behaviour runner, a `CLAUDE.md` pointer on the default embed install, a delivery leg in `/doctor:setup` and an OpenCode brief that keeps the command fields (segment two ranks 2, 3, 5, 8 to 11 and 13) | Complete |\n141:| 001-command-routing-baseline-corpus | 002-command-inventory-and-risk-metadata | Corpus rows exist for all 44 tracked commands and a baseline records per-command recall, with the four existing numbers unchanged | The baseline file exists and the existing routing-accuracy run still reports 158/195, 50/66 and 20/24 |\n144:| 004-command-meaning-matching | 005-recommendation-contract-and-brief | Holdout plain recall rises above 0 of 44 with false offers at 0 of 35 and typed recall at least 24 of 44, measured with the real embedding | The real-embedding capture and the full advisor suite |\n148:| 011-typed-command-delivery-and-guards | 012-plain-offer-reach | Phase 011 is committed, the command capture reads 44 of 44 typed rows and every pinned floor holds | `jq -c '.attachedMetrics.typed' .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json` prints `combined` 44 of 44 and phase 011 validates under `validate.sh --strict` |\n149:| 012-plain-offer-reach | 013-attribution-and-install-reach | Phase 012 is committed, its renderer prints `(needs a mode)` and its diff touches none of the files phase 013 edits | The committed command baseline reads `attachedMetrics.plain.tune.combined` above 9 of 45 and phase 012 validates under `validate.sh --strict` |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build && ls -1; echo \\\"=== spec reqs mentioning accuracy/holdout/arena ===\\\"; grep -n -i \\\"holdout\\\\|accuracy\\\\|arena\\\\|routing-accuracy\\\\|transcript\\\\|offer\\\" spec.md | head -40\"}"},"time":{"start":1794551323260,"end":1794551324615}}}}
