d` names which listing shows `create:readme`.\n139:- [ ] T046 Check the floors and the suite, then write `implementation-summary.md` and mark each row in `acceptance-criteria.md` with its evidence. Verify: `M` and `P` print the T001 numbers, `node $D --check` prints `fresh`, in `$ADV` `npx tsc --noEmit` exits 0 and `npm test` reports 0 failed, and `bash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/validate.sh <this folder> --strict` prints `RESULT: PASSED`.\n149:- [ ] All tasks marked `[x]`, or T031 and T032 marked not needed by T030\n150:- [ ] No `[B]` blocked tasks remaining\n151:- [ ] `$X/summary.json` shows a pre and a post start rate per measured runtime, zero unsafe starts and zero loops without init\n187:- [ ] CHK-002 [P0] The before numbers are in `$X/before.txt` (T001).\n188:- [ ] CHK-003 [P0] The pre-change commit holds no `COMMAND:` line (T002).\n196:- [ ] CHK-010 [P0] In `$ADV`, `npx tsc --noEmit` exits 0.\n197:- [ ] CHK-011 [P0] No code comment names a spec path, a phase number or a task id: `rg -n \"T0[0-9]{2}|REQ-0|specs/\" $S $R $T` prints nothing.\n198:- [ ] CHK-012 [P1] A reader failure yields exit 2 with the reader's code (T004, T015).\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof && ls; echo \\\"=== spec status ===\\\"; grep -n -i \\\"^status:\\\\|status:\\\" spec.md | head -5; echo \\\"=== impl summary head ===\\\"; grep -n -i \\\"status\\\\|complete\\\\|in progress\\\\|remaining\\\" implementation-summary.md | head -20; echo \\\"=== tasks open ===\\\"; grep -n \\\"\\\\- \\\\[ \\\\]\\\" tasks.md | head -10\"}"},"time":{"start":1794551367381,"end":1794551369849}}}}
