{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794551460233,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","part":{"partID":"prt_1d39a2edd002CNx1aiA9dTqWa5","sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","messageID":"msg_1d39a16a9001vrUSLK52D70WPS","type":"tool","id":"call_05f70ff25f734e3f9b0abe96","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner && sed -n '/## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS/,/ANCHOR:next-focus/p' deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n- `--dry-run` spawn-free claim: the replay is explicit in code comments and no doc claims otherwise; behavior note only (iteration 1, evidence: `run-command-behaviour.mjs:1043-1047`).\n- Staged-new-file restore gap: `restorePath` drops the index entry and deletes the file (iteration 1, evidence: `worktree-restore.mjs:61-84`).\n- Untracked-directory collapse as a silent restore gap: the pre-turn dirty guard makes it unreachable in measured arms (iteration 1, evidence: `run-command-behaviour.mjs:994-1000`).\n- Brief-detection false negatives across claude/codex/pi/devin/dsh: every head shape matches `BRIEF_PATTERN` (iteration 1, evidence: `render.ts:581-638`).\n- OpenCode `--auto` as a standalone finding: required to observe an ask row and covered by the arena model; folded into the environment finding (iteration 2, evidence: `run-command-behaviour.mjs:176-178`).\n- Prompt leakage through argv: corpus prompts are not secret and holdout ids are refused before a prompt reaches argv (iteration 2, evidence: `run-command-behaviour.mjs:583-594,724-727`).\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n- `--dry-run` spawn-free claim: the replay is explicit in code comments and no doc claims otherwise; behavior note only (iteration 1, evidence: `run-command-behaviour.mjs:1043-1047`).\n- Staged-new-file restore gap: `restorePath` drops the index entry and deletes the file (iteration 1, evidence: `worktree-restore.mjs:61-84`).\n- Untracked-directory collapse as a silent restore gap: the pre-turn dirty guard makes it unreachable in measured arms (iteration 1, evidence: `run-command-behaviour.mjs:994-1000`).\n- Brief-detection false negatives across claude/codex/pi/devin/dsh: every head shape matches `BRIEF_PATTERN` (iteration 1, evidence: `render.ts:581-638`).\n- OpenCode `--auto` as a standalone finding: required to observe an ask row and covered by the arena model; folded into the environment finding (iteration 2, evidence: `run-command-behaviour.mjs:176-178`).\n- Prompt leakage through argv: corpus prompts are not secret and holdout ids are refused before a prompt reaches argv (iteration 2, evidence: `run-command-behaviour.mjs:583-594,724-727`).\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner && sed -n '/## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS/,/ANCHOR:next-focus/p' deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794551459549,"end":1794551460233}}}}
