{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794551469598,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","part":{"partID":"prt_1d39a51ad001Fiot3pRg5W4dCc","sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","messageID":"msg_1d39a39230011Hs20KX7XvOPDh","type":"tool","id":"call_29471d9d5af84f909646cbd9","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Trying to promote the \"no arena assertion\" gap to P1 failed the reach test: the documented operator path runs from the arena clone, whose empty remote list satisfies the guard, so it stays P2 hardening (iteration 2).\n- A first reading of the runner README's restore sentence looked like a code defect; the code path is deliberate (exit 3, no restore), so the finding was narrowed to the documentation gap (iteration 3).","oldString":"- Trying to promote the \"no arena assertion\" gap to P1 failed the reach test: the documented operator path runs from the arena clone, whose empty remote list satisfies the guard, so it stays P2 hardening (iteration 2).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -68,8 +68,9 @@\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n - An early suspicion that the README named a non-existent Python file was wrong; the file exists, so the finding was narrowed to the real inventory drift (iteration 1).\n - Trying to promote the \"no arena assertion\" gap to P1 failed the reach test: the documented operator path runs from the arena clone, whose empty remote list satisfies the guard, so it stays P2 hardening (iteration 2).\n+- A first reading of the runner README's restore sentence looked like a code defect; the code path is deliberate (exit 3, no restore), so the finding was narrowed to the documentation gap (iteration 3).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Trying to promote the \\\"no arena assertion\\\" gap to P1 failed the reach test: the documented operator path runs from the arena clone, whose empty remote list satisfies the guard, so it stays P2 hardening (iteration 2).\\n- A first reading of the runner README's restore sentence looked like a code defect; the code path is deliberate (exit 3, no restore), so the finding was narrowed to the documentation gap (iteration 3).\",\"oldString\":\"- Trying to promote the \\\"no arena assertion\\\" gap to P1 failed the reach test: the documented operator path runs from the arena clone, whose empty remote list satisfies the guard, so it stays P2 hardening (iteration 2).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794551468461,"end":1794551469598}}}}
