{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794551744980,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","part":{"partID":"prt_1d39e7e73001jj3UBTOC4I4uNA","sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","messageID":"msg_1d39dff49001hDWk8on2E27RkP","type":"tool","id":"call_25b92b14503e4d8f9494ec45","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- A first reading of the runner README's restore sentence looked like a code defect; the code path is deliberate (exit 3, no restore), so the finding was narrowed to the documentation gap (iteration 3).\n- A bench typed against the full runtime tuple silently fails for five runtimes because both the type-check and the test glob exclude it by default (iteration 4).\n- Re-adjudicating two P1 findings to P2 after reading the independent-holdout gate's own doctrine and the runner's enumerated network claim (iteration 4); both stay active so the merge still sees them.","oldString":"- A first reading of the runner README's restore sentence looked like a code defect; the code path is deliberate (exit 3, no restore), so the finding was narrowed to the documentation gap (iteration 3).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -69,8 +69,10 @@\n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n - An early suspicion that the README named a non-existent Python file was wrong; the file exists, so the finding was narrowed to the real inventory drift (iteration 1).\n - Trying to promote the \"no arena assertion\" gap to P1 failed the reach test: the documented operator path runs from the arena clone, whose empty remote list satisfies the guard, so it stays P2 hardening (iteration 2).\n - A first reading of the runner README's restore sentence looked like a code defect; the code path is deliberate (exit 3, no restore), so the finding was narrowed to the documentation gap (iteration 3).\n+- A bench typed against the full runtime tuple silently fails for five runtimes because both the type-check and the test glob exclude it by default (iteration 4).\n+- Re-adjudicating two P1 findings to P2 after reading the independent-holdout gate's own doctrine and the runner's enumerated network claim (iteration 4); both stay active so the merge still sees them.\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- A first reading of the runner README's restore sentence looked like a code defect; the code path is deliberate (exit 3, no restore), so the finding was narrowed to the documentation gap (iteration 3).\\n- A bench typed against the full runtime tuple silently fails for five runtimes because both the type-check and the test glob exclude it by default (iteration 4).\\n- Re-adjudicating two P1 findings to P2 after reading the independent-holdout gate's own doctrine and the runner's enumerated network claim (iteration 4); both stay active so the merge still sees them.\",\"oldString\":\"- A first reading of the runner README's restore sentence looked like a code defect; the code path is deliberate (exit 3, no restore), so the finding was narrowed to the documentation gap (iteration 3).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794551742067,"end":1794551744980}}}}
