{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794551773349,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","part":{"partID":"prt_1d39e99b80014xaIdkXWONquU2","sessionID":"ses_e2c799a7bffe903YpgFMcmoKDC","messageID":"msg_1d39e9043001wu4ZzoLPSR6uoN","type":"tool","id":"call_605099617b9b482d8a57fe69","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Re-deriving every numeric floor in `spec.md` from the committed baseline turned traceability into arithmetic instead of a prose comparison, and all four held (iteration 3).\n- Checking a playbook's failure-triage symbols against the tree proved that chapter executable rather than assuming it (iteration 3).\n- Reading the independent-holdout gate as doctrine, not just as another test, produced the evidence that reclassified a P1 honestly instead of carrying an overstated claim to synthesis (iteration 4).\n- Checking how a bench is included (vitest env switch plus tsconfig exclusion) explained why a seven-runtime matrix with two keys survives CI (iteration 4).","oldString":"- Re-deriving every numeric floor in `spec.md` from the committed baseline turned traceability into arithmetic instead of a prose comparison, and all four held (iteration 3).\n- Checking a playbook's failure-triage symbols against the tree proved that chapter executable rather than assuming it (iteration 3).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner/deep-review-strategy.md\n================